commit 10abe701330500d518ee13247792a2e07394bd2a
Author: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 17:59:42 2026 +0000

    Fix the showcase specimens the audit found broken under the layer and re-seat the scrollspy on a face switch (unit AS2)
    
    The flex nowrap specimen carries one wrap name; the validation fields
    clear their tooltips with mb-4 and a pb-4 wrapper; each overflow frame
    sits in a ratio-1x1 box that holds its visible spill; the pinned badge's
    frame reads pt-2 with a label row; the stretched-link thumbnail keeps
    its 64 px square through align-self-start; the live dialog paragraph
    takes mb-3; the Underline colors specimens drop link-underline, the
    Scrolling table outgrows its card at 1280, and the position-helpers
    lists hold 13 rows. Showcase#select destroys and recreates the Scrollspy
    on every face change, with three journey cases reading Feedback after
    the settle. A census case refuses the 25 opposite-order shared pairs;
    the shadow, color-background, and gutters captions state their readings.
    U4.1, the matrix column floor, is stopped: no registry spelling meets
    the floor's properties (the probe is recorded). J3's hint lookup reads
    the outer ratio wrapper the overflow fix adds.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017fwYCgxCd9JhL43kVBLBJV

